      "to": "response",
      "role": "main"
    }
  ],
  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Precollected inputs",
      "items": [
        "Town reads are serial; medium reads are serial. Both groups run in parallel.",
        "Each product keeps its own publication time and age limit (short 24 h, mid 36 h); mid RSS is retired."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Order is behavior",
      "items": [
        "Observed and forecast values merge before extrema, icons, units and summaries.",
        "Missing products are logged and omitted; midData.dailyStatus lists daily gaps. 200 does not prove completeness."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Exits and item numbers",
      "items": [
        "400 and 302 are sent directly. next(err) from coord2addr and items 2, 30, 36, plus sync throws, skip app.js's 3-parameter handlers.",
        "Item numbers cite the v000903 appendix (v000901/v000902: airInfo, no warnings); coord2addr runs before item 1 on /coord only."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
